{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "accordion",
  "title": "Accordion",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 8,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A stack of questions or sections, each opening its panel on a spring. For content people read selectively; never to hide what everyone needs.",
    "id": "Tumpukan pertanyaan atau bagian yang masing-masing membuka panelnya dengan spring. Untuk isi yang dibaca sebagian saja; jangan pernah untuk menyembunyikan hal yang dibutuhkan semua orang."
  },
  "titleId": "Accordion",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Questions, one open at a time",
        "desc": "With `data-lds-accordion=\"single\"` opening one closes the other.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc\" data-lds-accordion=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq1-b\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq1\">Can I change my schedule after registering?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel is-open\" id=\"faq1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq1-b\"><div><p>Yes, until the end of the second week. After that, changes need your adviser's approval.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq2-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq2\">Where do I find my transcript?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq2-b\"><div><p>Under Academics, then Records. You can download it as a PDF.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq3-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq3\">What happens if I miss an exam?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq3-b\"><div><p>Ask for a make-up exam within three days with a letter that explains why.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Two-line titles and rich content",
        "desc": "`.acc__title` with `.acc__sub`, and `.acc__content` for a list and an action. Several can be open.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc acc--fill\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec1\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Section 1: verbal reasoning<span class=\"acc__sub\">35 questions · 40 minutes</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec1\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Questions test vocabulary, analogies and reading.</p><ul><li>Each correct answer scores 5.</li><li>Wrong and empty answers score 0.</li></ul><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"align-self: flex-start;\">Try 5 sample questions</button></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec2\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Section 2: numerical reasoning<span class=\"acc__sub\">30 questions · 30 minutes</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec2\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Series, arithmetic and word problems. Calculators are not allowed.</p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Pertanyaan, satu terbuka sekaligus",
        "desc": "Dengan `data-lds-accordion=\"single\"`, membuka satu butir menutup butir lain.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc\" data-lds-accordion=\"single\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq1-b\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq1\">Bisakah saya mengubah jadwal setelah mendaftar?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel is-open\" id=\"faq1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq1-b\"><div><p>Bisa, sampai akhir minggu kedua. Setelah itu, perubahan perlu persetujuan wali kelas.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq2-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq2\">Di mana saya menemukan rapor saya?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq2-b\"><div><p>Di menu Akademik, lalu Riwayat. Anda bisa mengunduhnya sebagai PDF.</p></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" id=\"faq3-b\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq3\">Bagaimana jika saya tidak ikut ujian?<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"faq3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq3-b\"><div><p>Ajukan ujian susulan paling lambat tiga hari dengan surat yang menjelaskan alasannya.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Judul dua baris dan isi kaya",
        "desc": "`.acc__title` dengan `.acc__sub`, dan `.acc__content` untuk daftar dan aksi. Beberapa butir bisa terbuka bersamaan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"acc acc--fill\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec1\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Bagian 1: penalaran verbal<span class=\"acc__sub\">35 soal · 40 menit</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec1\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Soal menguji kosakata, analogi, dan pemahaman bacaan.</p><ul><li>Setiap jawaban benar bernilai 5.</li><li>Jawaban salah dan kosong bernilai 0.</li></ul><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"align-self: flex-start;\">Coba 5 contoh soal</button></div></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"acc__item\"><button class=\"acc__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sec2\"><span class=\"acc__title\">Bagian 2: penalaran numerik<span class=\"acc__sub\">30 soal · 30 menit</span></span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button><div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"sec2\" role=\"region\"><div><div class=\"acc__content\"><p>Deret angka, aritmetika, dan soal cerita. Kalkulator tidak boleh dipakai.</p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { AccordionItem } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\n<div className=\"acc\">\n  <AccordionItem title=\"Section 1: verbal reasoning\" sub=\"35 questions · 40 minutes\" defaultOpen>\n    <p>Questions test vocabulary, analogies and reading.</p>\n  </AccordionItem>\n</div>",
